I pull my suitcase and my bags into the flat.
Then I close the door.
Finally, I am truly at home.
The hallway is small, but very nice.
The flat is already furnished.
I look around quietly.
A mirror hangs next to the door.
A coat rack hangs on the wall.
A shoe rack stands under the coat rack.
That is all very practical.
I take off my jacket.
My jacket is now hanging on the coat rack.
I put my shoes into the rack.
A small rug lies on the floor.
A small table stands next to the mirror.
My keys lie on the table.
My heavy bags are still standing on the rug.
I take the bags.
I continue into the living room.
